{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CnGU2DkKdrHVWRXH9Hwzxf","type":"tool_result","content":"services:\n  mosquitto:\n    image: eclipse-mosquitto:2.0\n    container_name: mqtt_broker\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      # MQTT n'est pas HTTP : lié à l'IP Tailscale uniquement (jamais 0.0.0.0)\n      - \"${TAILSCALE_IP}:1883:1883\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./config:/mosquitto/config:ro\n      - ${STACK_STATE}/data:/mosquitto/data\n    networks:\n      - traefik-net\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"mosquitto_sub -t '$$SYS/#' -C 1 -W 3 -i healthcheck || exit 1\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 3\n\nnetworks:\n  traefik-net:\n    external: true\nconfig:\nmosquitto.conf\nlistener 1883\nallow_anonymous true\npersistence true\npersistence_location /mosquitto/data/\nlog_dest stdout\n---\n[{\"Type\":\"volume\",\"Name\":\"mosquitto_mosquitto_data\",\"Source\":\"/var/lib/docker/volumes/mosquitto_mosquitto_data/_data\",\"Destination\":\"/mosquitto/data\",\"Driver\":\"local\",\"Mode\":\"rw\",\"RW\":true,\"Propagation\":\"\"},{\"Type\":\"volume\",\"Name\":\"8e40d46b6ab784cde3f751c2ada89c1d692e34b1f7892f4dff49c8686802920a\",\"Source\":\"/var/lib/docker/volumes/8e40d46b6ab784cde3f751c2ada89c1d692e34b1f7892f4dff49c8686802920a/_data\",\"Destination\":\"/mosquitto/log\",\"Driver\":\"local\",\"Mode\":\"\",\"RW\":true,\"Propagation\":\"\"},{\"Type\":\"bind\",\"Source\":\"/home/legacyuser/mosquitto/config\",\"Destination\":\"/mosquitto/config\",\"Mode\":\"rw\",\"RW\":true,\"Propagation\":\"rprivate\"}]\n{\"Test\":[\"CMD-SHELL\",\"mosquitto_sub -t '$SYS/#' -C 1 -W 3 -i healthcheck || exit 1\"],\"Interval\":10000000000,\"Timeout\":5000000000,\"StartPeriod\":5000000000,\"StartInterval\":1000000000,\"Retries\":3}\n# Broker MQTT partagé du Raspberry — infrastructure commune à tous les projets\n# (pc-power-controller, fan_controller, ...). Un seul broker par machine.\n\npersistence true\npersistence_location /mosquitto/data/\n\n# Logs sur stdout : consultables avec `docker logs mqtt_broker`.\nlog_dest stdout\n\nlistener 1883 0.0.0.0\n\n# Broker exposé uniquement sur le réseau local. Pour activer l'authentification\n# plus tard (nécessite de reflasher les ESP avec les identifiants) :\n#   docker exec mqtt_broker mosquitto_passwd -c /mosquitto/config/passwd <utilisateur>\n# puis remplacer la ligne ci-dessous par :\n#   allow_anonymous false\n#   password_file /mosquitto/config/passwd\nallow_anonymous true\nuid=1003(ai-infra) gid=1003(infra) groups=1003(infra),992(docker)\nMatching Defaults entries for ai-infra on raspberrypi:\n    env_reset, mail_badpass, secure_path=/usr/local/sbin\\:/usr/local/bin\\:/usr/sbin\\:/usr/bin\\:/sbin\\:/bin, use_pty, env_keep+=NO_AT_BRIDGE, env_keep+=DPKG_DEB_THREADS_MAX, timestamp_type=global, env_keep+=\"http_proxy HTTP_PROXY\", env_keep+=\"https_proxy HTTPS_PROXY\", env_keep+=\"ftp_proxy FTP_PROXY\", env_keep+=RSYNC_PROXY, env_keep+=\"no_proxy NO_PROXY\", log_input, log_output\n\nUser ai-infra may run the following commands on raspberrypi:\n    (root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/systemctl, /usr/bin/tailscale, /usr/bin/apt-get, /usr/local/bin/infra, /usr/sbin/useradd, /usr/sbin/usermod, /usr/sbin/usermod, /usr/bin/passwd -l *, /usr/bin/tee /etc/sudoers.d/ai-*\n/usr/bin/mosquitto_sub\n/usr/bin/mosquitto_pub","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aaa12a2f-ae27-88f4-f438-ba2e90300311","uuid":"60007982-9344-ee33-c146-baadec844c04","timestamp":"2026-10-25T15:29:40.098Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"services:\n  mosquitto:\n    image: eclipse-mosquitto:2.0\n    container_name: mqtt_broker\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      # MQTT n'est pas HTTP : lié à l'IP Tailscale uniquement (jamais 0.0.0.0)\n      - \"${TAILSCALE_IP}:1883:1883\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./config:/mosquitto/config:ro\n      - ${STACK_STATE}/data:/mosquitto/data\n    networks:\n      - traefik-net\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"mosqui